MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 78c39ca0aa3b4c60ad7cb11e9f4cf262, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialTopic_Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Features.Tutorial.Data.TutorialTopicData
  <Title>k__BackingField: Intro
  <Chapters>k__BackingField:
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Welcome!
    <Description>k__BackingField: 'Thanks for trying Medieval Merchant.

      You
      are a traveling trader. Move between towns, buy goods where they are cheap,
      and sell them at a profit elsewhere. Watch prices, plan your routes, and decide
      where your cargo is most valuable. Your success comes from understanding supply
      and demand and helping towns thrive while turning a profit.'
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 489cf1137e4ac184c915a339106a22e4, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Towns & Growth
    <Description>k__BackingField: When you supply a town with what it lacks, it will
      grow. Growing towns produce more goods, unlock new products, and offer better
      trading opportunities. Trading and fulfilling a towns needs also improves their
      relationship with you.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 489cf1137e4ac184c915a339106a22e4, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Goods
    <Description>k__BackingField: Trade goods come in 3 tiers, each more valuable
      than the one before. As towns grow they will demand more sophisticated goods
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 489cf1137e4ac184c915a339106a22e4, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Prices
    <Description>k__BackingField: Higher tier goods have higher base prices. But
      prices are affected by many factors in this supply-demand driven economy. Watch
      out how things develop across the years and you will find great opportunities
      to make some sweet sweet coin.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 489cf1137e4ac184c915a339106a22e4, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Good Luck!
    <Description>k__BackingField: 'That is all for now :)

      You will learn more
      as you play. Enjoy the journey!'
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 489cf1137e4ac184c915a339106a22e4, type: 3}
